    "body": "Looking at the code, I suggest the following changes:\r\nMake the regex  (?:version)[^\\d\\.]*(?P<version>[\\d\\.]+)\r\nUse '-version' instead of '-Xinternalversion' for the java command line argument.\r\nI'm not 100% sure that will catch everything, but it is likely better than the current implementation.",
