    "created_at": "2022-11-16T16:15:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-11-16T16:15:11Z",
    "body": "The reason we use `-Xinternalversion` instead of `-version` is because `-version` is much, *much* slower. (For a concrete idea of numbers, on my dev desktop, it's 1.7ms for `-Xinternalversion` and 42ms for `-version`. I think I've seen upwards of 200ms on slower machines).\r\n\r\nDoes your regex change work even if we don't make the change to the CLI argument?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
